%h3 Hi Nitrous.IO Admin,

%p Please investigate why these boxes are dangling, help to fix/destroy the box and apologize to the owner, thanks!

%p Yours sincerely,
%p The Dangle Bot

- if @paid_boxes.present?

  %h4 Boxes of Paid Users

  %p
    %table
      %tr
        %th ID
        %th Name
        %th State
        %th Region
        %th Owner's Email
        %th Created At (UTC)

      - @paid_boxes.each do |box|
        %tr
          %td= box.id
          %td= box.name
          %td= box.state
          %td= box.region.name
          %td= box.owner.email
          %td= box.created_at.strftime('%e %b %Y %H:%m:%S%p')

